{"slug":"teradata-online-training","id":"3774","title":"TeraData Online Training","description":"<h3>About TeraData Online Training</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Teradata</strong> is a fully scalable relational database management system produced by Teradata Corp. It is widely used to manage large data warehousing operations. <strong>Teradata</strong> is basically a database, that is designed to handle analytical queries.</p>\n<h3>Prerequisites For Learning TeraData Online Training</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Graduates/Post Graduates are eligible.</li>\n<li>Everyone must have knowledge on SQL and PL/SQL.</li>\n<li>Basic Knowledge on UNIX Shell Scripting.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Terms And Conditions</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>We will Provide Supporting to resolve Student practical Issues.</li>\n<li>We will provide server Access and 100% Lab Facility.</li>\n<li>Resume Preparation.</li>\n<li>Interview Questions &amp; Answers.</li>\n<li>We will conduct mock interviews. Student also gets 100% supporting before and after getting job.</li>\n</ul>","curriculumInfo":"1 Section9 Lessons10 Weeks","sections":[{"id":"41","title":"TeraData Online Training Course Content","count":"9","collapsed":true,"items":[{"id":"3776","order":1,"type":"lp_lesson","url":"/courses/teradata-online-training/lessons/overview-and-new-feature/","number":"2.1","title":"Overview And New Feature","status":"locked"},{"id":"3777","order":2,"type":"lp_lesson","url":"/courses/teradata-online-training/lessons/websphere-installation-and-migration-installation-and-migration/","number":"2.2","title":"Websphere Installation And Migration Installation And Migration","status":"locked"},{"id":"3778","order":3,"type":"lp_lesson","url":"/courses/teradata-online-training/lessons/websphere-system-management/","number":"2.3","title":"Websphere System Management","status":"locked"},{"id":"3779","order":4,"type":"lp_lesson","url":"/courses/teradata-online-training/lessons/websphere-security/","number":"2.4","title":"Websphere Securit